    <item>
      <title>The magic of file</title>
      <link>https://omairmajid.com/posts/2020-06-10-magic-of-file/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://omairmajid.com/posts/2020-06-10-magic-of-file/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Ever wonder how &lt;code&gt;file(1)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;sup id=&#34;fnref:1&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#fn:1&#34; class=&#34;footnote-ref&#34; role=&#34;doc-noteref&#34;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; works?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After reading this post, you should understand all about &lt;code&gt;file&lt;/code&gt; and
its underpinnings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;file&#34;&gt;file&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using the &lt;code&gt;file&lt;/code&gt; tool is quite simple. It&amp;rsquo;s just &lt;code&gt;file file-name-1&lt;/code&gt;.
You can call it with multiple arguments too. Here&amp;rsquo;s a few examples of
running it on my system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ file document.pdf
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;document.pdf: PDF document, version 1.4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ file image.jpg
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;image.jpg: JPEG image data, Exif standard: &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;TIFF image data, big-endian, direntries&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt; ...orientation&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;upper-left, datetime&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;2019:10:30 21:44:30, width&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;1740&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;, baseline, precision 8, 2017x961, components &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ file video.mp4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;video.mp4: ISO Media, MP4 v2 &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;ISO 14496-14&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ file notes.org
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;notes.org: UTF-8 Unicode text, with very long lines
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ file /dev/video0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;/dev/video0: character special &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;81/0&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can already see a few things:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
